  "description": "Memory Indexer SDK - Long-term memory management for LLM applications via MCP (Model Context Protocol). Features semantic search, vector storage, PII detection, prompt injection defense, and OpenTelemetry observability.",
  "id": "MemoryIndexer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-12-11T02:58:45.757Z",
